**Why one bullet_list and not three separate components:** Items under different category labels (Winners / Breakeven / Losing) are still a SINGLE list of parallel statements. Splitting into three components would create three separate visual blocks for no reason. bullet_list supports inline formatting to differentiate the categories visually.

